# Percepta frontend environment
#
# The frontend needs NO environment variables anymore. It calls the Percepta
# backend at the relative path /api (proxied to http://localhost:3001 in dev —
# see vite.config.js). It never talks to Supabase directly.
#
# All Supabase configuration (SUPABASE_URL, SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY) lives
# in ../server/.env and must stay server-side only. Do not add any VITE_-prefixed
# secrets — anything prefixed with VITE_ is embedded in the browser bundle.
